{"sha": "b0dbc8d39cd6b5f42f4a1d4556313247a640bbf06891858c70ac82ac6da6714e", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=10.5]", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (-0.03,0) -- (1.08,0);", "  % a_n increasing (omDef), b_n decreasing (omProp)", "  \\fill[omDef] (0,0) circle (0.3pt) node[below=2pt, font=\\small]", "    {$a_0$};", "  \\fill[omDef] (0.18,0) circle (0.3pt) node[below=2pt,", "    font=\\small] {$a_1$};", "  \\fill[omDef] (0.30,0) circle (0.3pt) node[below=2pt,", "    font=\\small] {$a_2$};", "  \\fill[omDef] (0.37,0) circle (0.3pt);", "  \\fill[omDef] (0.41,0) circle (0.3pt);", "  \\fill[omProp] (1.0,0) circle (0.3pt) node[below=2pt,", "    font=\\small] {$b_0$};", "  \\fill[omProp] (0.78,0) circle (0.3pt) node[below=2pt,", "    font=\\small] {$b_1$};", "  \\fill[omProp] (0.62,0) circle (0.3pt) node[below=2pt,", "    font=\\small] {$b_2$};", "  \\fill[omProp] (0.54,0) circle (0.3pt);", "  \\fill[omProp] (0.50,0) circle (0.3pt);", "  \\draw[omThm, thick] (0.455,-0.014) -- (0.455,0.014);", "  \\node[above, omThm, font=\\small] at (0.455,0.02) {$\\ell$};", "  \\draw[Stealth-Stealth, gray] (0.30,0.05) -- (0.62,0.05);", "  \\node[above, font=\\small, text=gray] at (0.46,0.055)", "    {$b_n - a_n \\to 0$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 相邻数列：$(a_n)$ 递增，$(b_n)$ 递减，", "两者之间的间距趋于 $0$。每个区间", "$\\intcc{a_n}{b_n}$ 包含之后的所有区间，而公共极限", "$\\ell$ 是唯一留在每个区间中的点 --- 这幅图背后是", "下文波尔查诺--魏尔斯特拉斯定理的二分法证明，", "以及在", "\\cref{ch:b1:continuity}中的介值定理的直观背景。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[自然常数 $\\eu$]\\label{ex:b1:seq:e}", "设 $a_n = \\sum_{k=0}^{n} \\frac{1}{k!}$，$b_n = a_n + \\frac{1}{n", "\\cdot n!}$（$n \\geq 1$）。则 $(a_n)$ 递增；且", "\\[", "b_{n+1} - b_n = \\frac{1}{(n+1)!} + \\frac{1}{(n+1)(n+1)!} -", "\\frac{1}{n\\,n!}", "= \\frac{n(n+1) + n - (n+1)^2}{n(n+1)(n+1)!}", "= \\frac{-1}{n(n+1)(n+1)!} < 0 ,", "\\]", "于是 $(b_n)$ 递减，且 $b_n - a_n \\to 0$，故二者相邻。它们的公共", "极限（此处按定义）即为自然常数 $\\eu \\approx 2.71828$；", "不等式 $a_n < \\eu < b_n$ 足以证明 $\\eu \\notin", "\\Q$（见\\cref{exo:b1:seq:9}）。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{子列与波尔查诺--魏尔斯特拉斯定理}", "", "\\begin{definition}[子列]\\label{def:b1:seq:subsequence}", "称 $(u_n)$ 的\\emph{子列}\\index{子列}为", "数列 $(u_{\\varphi(n)})$，其中 $\\varphi \\colon \\N \\to \\N$ 严格递增", "（由归纳法可得 $\\varphi(n) \\geq n$）。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}\\label{prop:b1:seq:subsequences}", "若 $u_n \\to \\ell$（$\\ell \\in \\R$ 或 $\\pm\\infty$），则其每个子列", "都趋于 $\\ell$。由此，若数列有两个", "极限不同的子列，则该数列发散。反之，若 $(u_{2n})$ 与", "$(u_{2n+1})$ 都收敛于\\emph{同一个} $\\ell$，则 $u_n \\to", "\\ell$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "超过阈值 $N$（对 $(u_n)$ 而言）之后，所有指标 $\\varphi(n) \\geq n", "\\geq N$ 均满足要求（不等式 $\\varphi(n) \\geq n$ 正是", "\\cref{def:b1:seq:subsequence}中所述的归纳：$\\varphi(0)", "\\geq 0$，且 $\\varphi(n+1) > \\varphi(n) \\geq n$ 推出", "$\\varphi(n+1) \\geq n + 1$）。对于逆命题，给定", "$\\varepsilon$，取两个阈值 $N_0$（偶数项）和 $N_1$", "（奇数项）；任取指标 $n \\geq \\max(2N_0, 2N_1 + 1)$，则", "其或为偶数，$n = 2k$ 且 $k \\geq N_0$；或为奇数，$n = 2k+1$ 且", "$k \\geq N_1$ --- 两种情形下均有 $\\abs{u_n - \\ell} \\leq", "\\varepsilon$：每个指标都被两个子列之一覆盖，", "这正是证明的要点。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[子列极限]\\label{ex:b1:seq:sublimits}", "对于 $u_n = (-1)^n \\frac{n}{n+1}$：偶数项构成的子列趋于", "$1$，奇数项子列趋于 $-1$，故该数列发散 --- 但其", "发散方式是有序的，聚集在两个值 $\\pm 1$ 附近。", "对于 $u_n = \\cos\\frac{2\\pi n}{3}$：取下标分别为", "$3k$、$3k + 1$、$3k + 2$ 的三个子列均为常数，分别等于 $1$、", "$-\\frac12$、$-\\frac12$；子列极限的集合为 $\\{1,", "-\\frac12\\}$。总结要点是：\\emph{有界}数列", "当且仅当它恰有一个子列极限时收敛", "（见\\cref{exo:b1:seq:8}）；有界数列的发散总是", "意味着至少有两个聚点，而下文的波尔查诺--魏尔斯特拉斯定理", "保证至少存在一个子列极限。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[波尔查诺--魏尔斯特拉斯定理]\\label{thm:b1:seq:bw}", "每个有界实数列都有一个", "收敛子列。\\index{波尔查诺--魏尔斯特拉斯定理}", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "设 $u_n \\in \\intcc{a}{b}$（对所有 $n$）。用二分法构造嵌套", "区间：取 $\\intcc{a_0}{b_0} = \\intcc{a}{b}$；给定", "$\\intcc{a_k}{b_k}$ 包含 $u_n$（对无穷多个 $n$），则其两半之一", "仍包含 $u_n$（对无穷多个 $n$） --- 记为", "$\\intcc{a_{k+1}}{b_{k+1}}$。数列 $(a_k)$、$(b_k)$ 相邻", "（$b_k - a_k = \\frac{b-a}{2^k} \\to 0$），其公共极限为", "$\\ell$（见\\cref{thm:b1:seq:adjacent}）。", "", "取子列：选取 $\\varphi(0)$，使 $u_{\\varphi(0)} \\in", "\\intcc{a_0}{b_0}$；再归纳地，取 $\\varphi(k+1) > \\varphi(k)$", "使 $u_{\\varphi(k+1)} \\in \\intcc{a_{k+1}}{b_{k+1}}$ --- 这是可能的", "因为该区间含有无穷多项。于是 $a_k \\leq", "u_{\\varphi(k)} \\leq b_k$，由夹逼定理得", "$u_{\\varphi(k)} \\to \\ell$。", "\\end{proof}", ""]}